# ── Backend (backend/.env) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Full template: backend/.env.example
#   Required to boot: MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET (32+ chars), JWT_REFRESH_SECRET (32+ chars)

# ── Frontend (frontend/.env.local) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Full template: frontend/.env.example
#   Required: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL